  "versionLabel": "Version 1.0.0",
  "aboutContent": "SmartLoan Calc is a minimalist, offline-first personal loan planning tool.\n\nIt supports Equal Payment, Equal Principal and Interest-First repayment methods across mortgage, car and consumer loan scenarios, plus combined loans, prepayment simulation, affordability assessment and LPR rate conversion.\n\nCore principles: instant results, big numbers first, dark mode, data never leaves your device.",
  "privacyContent": "Privacy Policy Highlights\n\n1. No collection: this app collects no personal, device or usage data.\n2. No upload: zero network requests; all computation happens on-device.\n3. Local storage: saved plans and history live only in the on-device app sandbox (Hive database) and are removed when the app is uninstalled.\n4. No account: no sign-up, no third-party analytics SDKs.\n5. Exported files: schedule PDF / CSV files leave the device only through the system share sheet when you explicitly share them.\n\nIf any network feature is introduced in the future, this policy will be updated with prominent in-app notice.",
  "disclaimerContent": "Disclaimer\n\nAll results provided by this app (including but not limited to monthly payments, total interest, repayment schedules, prepayment estimates, affordability assessment and rate conversion) are theoretical estimates based on public financial formulas. They are for reference only and do not constitute loan, investment or financial advice.\n\nActual loan amounts, rates, fees and approvals are subject to the final decision of banks and licensed financial institutions. City mortgage and housing fund policy data are static snapshots and may differ from the latest policies; please refer to your local housing fund center and banks.\n\nDecisions made using results from this app are at your own risk.",
  "offlineBadge": "Offline only · Data stays on device"
